    "https://jobs.citadel.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-physical-activity-courses-pooled-position-charleston-south-carolina-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position)",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position) - Charleston, South Carolina, United States Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position) - Charleston, South Carolina, United States Kiosk mode Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Adjunct Faculty Add to favorites View favorites Job Responsibilities The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is currently accepting applications to establish a pool of qualified candidates for adjunct faculty assignments. These positions may be temporary, part-time, and/or on-call, with appointments made either immediately or as departmental needs arise. This posting is intended to create a pool of candidates for future part-time teaching opportunities and is not for a specific assignment or a full-time faculty position. Primary responsibilities include teaching undergraduate Required Physical Education (RPED) activity courses. Course offerings may include, but are not limited to, weight training, swimming, first aid/CPR, racquet sports, yoga, archery, golf, martial arts, and other physical activity and wellness courses. Minimum Qualifications Applicants must possess a bachelor's degree and relevant professional, coaching, military, or instructional experience in the subject area. Some courses may require applicants to hold appropriate professional certifications or licenses. Preferred Qualifications Previous teaching experience. Relevant professional, coaching, or instructional experience. Current professional or nationally recognized certifications applicable to the course being taught. *Please provide your resume, cover letter, and names of three references with your application. Start Your Application First Name (required) 96130684 Last Name (required) 6356cdf1 Email (required) 506ae675 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you. You'll be redirected to login and continue your application! Recommended Jobs HVAC Techni